0.00, but its scope is unknown; it is not established as a per-person or all-in amount.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The search results show no complete selectable journey, and coverage is partial: a direct-route detail query was omitted and related queries were only partially covered. Confirm current award availability, schedules, fees, and booking terms with the relevant programs before making plans.\"}]}",
